{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "Vibh (PTS 1904[1978]: 270)"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0002008", "type": "mod", "text": "同上，五九六項、六七六項，自同處譯為「女根、男根、命根、身表、語表、虛空界、色輕性、色軟性、色堪任性、色積集、色寂靜、色老性、色無常性、摶食」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "分別論之「分別」及蘊分別等各品之「分別」之文字為 vibhaṅga，各品中之經分別，對法分別之「分別」為 bhājaniya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001002", "type": "orig", "text": "依據註釋書，「五」者即數之限定，與五相比較不多不少之意，「蘊」者即聚（rāsi）、德（guṇa）、施設（paṇṇatti）、慣用（ruḷhi）之意思，在本論可見依聚義以為塊、眾、集、聚、區分之義，例如：所謂色蘊者是「以聚為相」、「以區分為相」，為色聚、色區分之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001003", "type": "orig", "text": "依據註釋書以說欲之問為當問法之表示。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001004", "type": "orig", "text": "依據註釋書，所謂「諸所有」者是「全部所攝者」，而「色」者是「止容有過」，此二語為攝無過不及色。以下全部依此形式。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001005", "type": "orig", "text": "依註釋書，色（rūpa）者是依可壞之義、可壞之相而名之為色，前者即動、礙、壓迫、破壞，後者為寒、熱、陽熱、蛇等之苦難。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001006", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論（Dhammasaṅgani）之 Nekkhepakaṇḍa。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002007", "type": "orig", "text": "同上，參閱一〇 四四項以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002008", "type": "orig", "text": "同上，五九六項、六七六項，自同處譯為「女根、男根、命根、身表、語表、虛空界、色輕性、色軟性、色堪任性、色積集、色寂靜、色老性、色無常性、搏食」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0015009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0015009", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 rūpaṁ，而法集論、註釋書皆為 rūpiyaṁ，因此譯為應變壞。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016010", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論五八五項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0016011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0016011", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論五八六項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0017012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0017012", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論五八八項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0017013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0017013", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論五九〇 項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0020014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0020014 #note_star_1", "type": "orig", "text": "原本 ganthaniyo。（順繫）脫落。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0045015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0045015", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 āsavo ceva no ca āsavo 讀為 āsavasampayutto ceva no ca āsavo。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067001", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論五九七項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067002", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論六〇一項、六〇五項、六〇九項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0067003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0067003", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論六一三項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0068004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0068004", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論六一七項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0068005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0068005", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論六二一項、六二五項、六二九項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0068006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0068006", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論六四八項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0070007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0070007", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論五九六項、六六〇項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0071008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0071008", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論六五四項、六五六項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077009", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 upādānavippayutta-anupādāniyā ti 讀為 upādānavippayutta-upādāniya ti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078010", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 dasāyatanā dassanena pahātabbā，依暹羅本為 dasāyatanā na dassanena pahātabbā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0082001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0082001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 tambitattaṁ，可讀為 chambitattaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0082002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0082002", "type": "orig", "text": "同上。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0089003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0089003", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱蘊分別品之註[08]。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092004", "type": "orig", "text": "原本九十二頁十八行之 siyā uppādiniyo，可讀為 siyā uppādino。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093005", "type": "orig", "text": "原本九十三頁四行之 sahetukā cūti pi，可讀為 sahetukā cāti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0093006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0093006", "type": "orig", "text": "原本九十三頁六行之 na ca ahetūti，可讀為 na ca hetūti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094007", "type": "orig", "text": "原本九十四頁二十行之 sujā saṅyojaniyā，可讀為 siyā saṅyojaniyā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100001", "type": "orig", "text": "依據註釋，不幸者即拋棄利益，而血緣之不幸者即「依盜病怖畏等而使血緣完全消滅」，財富之不幸者是「依王、盜等而使財富完全消滅」，病之不幸者乃「因病有害健康」，戒之不幸者是「惡戒」，見之不幸者是「正見消失而生見」，他人等者乃「自己之執著，或不執著所有之同僚友人、他人之不幸」，所具足者是「使束縛」，種種之苦法者則為「生苦之種種原因」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109002", "type": "orig", "text": "於對法分別不為四聖諦而為四諦，有關註釋則記為「聖諦者不攝餘之煩惱、餘之不善法、三有漏善法。唯渴愛不集。是等亦為苦集，為明集因而不言聖諦，為四諦」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0121003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0121003", "type": "orig", "text": "依原本之註釋譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0125004", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 kilesasampayuttā，可讀為 kilesavippayuttā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0126005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0126005", "type": "orig", "text": "依暹羅本更正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0128001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0128001", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱蘊分別之對法分別中之識分別。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0136002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0136002", "type": "orig", "text": "在原本與十五根同樣為「不可言以蓋為蓋相應或以蓋相應為非蓋」。然應無必要特別提出憂根。徵於前列之敘述法，如其譯文加予推定而譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0143001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0143001", "type": "orig", "text": "一蘊有（ekavokārabhava）、四蘊有（catuvokārabhava）、五蘊有（Pañcavokārabhava）之蘊（Vokāra）者，為異欺（梵語 Vyavacāra）而真諦在俱舍論譯為「判」，玄奘則譯為「行」。稱友之俱舍釋作為「異欺者即迦葉波如來名之為蘊」，又為「五異欺者即五蘊也」。又稱友為「差別而欺者為異欺，為異而欺誑之義」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0144002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0144002", "type": "orig", "text": "諦分別中，參閱苦諦分別愁苦之註（本卷一五九頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0156003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0156003", "type": "orig", "text": "界分別中，參閱無明界之項（本卷一〇六頁）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0186004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0186004", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為「由名而有識」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0188005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0188005", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論三六五項以下。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0191006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0191006", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱同一〇六〇項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0193007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0193007", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱同四二五項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0194008", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱同四二九項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0194009", "type": "orig", "text": "欲界八大心之一。參閱法集論（一～一五九）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0194009", "type": "mod", "text": "欲界八大心之一。參閱法集論（一【南傳】，～一五九）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0195010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0195010", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論三四項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197011", "type": "orig", "text": "色界善法。參閱法集論（一六〇項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0198012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0198012", "type": "orig", "text": "無色界善法。參閱同（二六五項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199013", "type": "orig", "text": "出世間善法。參閱同（二七七項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200014", "type": "orig", "text": "善異熟五識。參閱同（四三一項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0201015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0201015", "type": "orig", "text": "此之（五）等者即與論母之（五）等相應為（五）等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0201016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0201016", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 saṅkhārakkhandho viññāṇaṁ，應讀為 saṅkhārapaccayā viññāṇaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0202017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0202017", "type": "orig", "text": "原本只記為「緣名而有第六處，緣觸而有受」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0202018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0202018", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論四四三項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0202019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0202019", "type": "orig", "text": "善異熟意界。參閱法集論（四五五項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0203020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0203020", "type": "orig", "text": "原本（PTS P176）為 cetosamphassajā sātā adukkhamasukhā vcdanā。除此 sātā 而譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0203021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0203021", "type": "orig", "text": "善異熟喜俱行意識界。參閱法集論（四六九項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204022", "type": "orig", "text": "善異熟捨俱行意識界。參閱同（四八四項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204023", "type": "orig", "text": "原本無「由已作」之句，譯者插入之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0204024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0204024", "type": "orig", "text": "八大異熟。參閱法集論四九八項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0205025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0205025", "type": "orig", "text": "色界之異熟。參閱法集論（四九九項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0206026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0206026", "type": "orig", "text": "無色界之異熟。參閱法集論（五〇一項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0207027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0207027", "type": "orig", "text": "淨道（Suddhikapaṭipadā）。參閱法集論（五〇五項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0207028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0207028", "type": "orig", "text": "不善異熟無記。參閱法集論（五五六項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0209029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0209029", "type": "orig", "text": "欲界作無記。參閱法集論（五六六項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0211030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0211030", "type": "orig", "text": "色界作無記。參閱法集論（五七七項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0211031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0211031", "type": "orig", "text": "無色界作無記。參閱法集論（五七九項以下）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0212032", "type": "orig", "text": "欲界八大心。參閱法集論（一～一五九）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212032", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0212032", "type": "mod", "text": "欲界八大心。參閱法集論（一【南傳】，～一五九）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 imahā loke，應讀為 imamhi loke。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228002", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為「樂受」。錯誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228003", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為「樂受」。錯誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0228004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0228004", "type": "orig", "text": "原本為「內受」。錯誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0234005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0234005", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 anuppanassa kāmacchandassa pahānaṁ，應讀為 uppanassa……。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0241006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0241006", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 na hctū-sahetuka，應讀為 na hetu sahetu。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0244001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0244001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 akusalānaṁ dhammānaṁ Chandaṁ janeti, pahānāya（為捨離）之字脫落。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0253001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0253001", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論一一、一五、五四、五七項等。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0254002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0254002", "type": "orig", "text": "原本脫落 iminā ca samādhinā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0258003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0258003", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論一項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268001", "type": "orig", "text": "依止離、依止離貪、依止滅（vivekanissitaṁ virāganissitaṁ nirodhanissitaṁ）者，在翻譯名義大集為「居處寂靜、居處離欲、居處阻礙」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268002", "type": "orig", "text": "參閱法集論二九二項。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0286001", "type": "orig", "text": "戒口（mukha）者，於註釋有 yathā hi sattāmaṁ catubhido āhāro mukhena pavisitvā angamaṅgāni pharati, evaṁ yogino pi catubhūmakakusalaṁ sīlamukhena pavisitvā athasiddhiṁ sampādeti. tena Vuttaṁ mukhan ti 之說明。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0286002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0286002", "type": "orig", "text": "極戒口（pāmokkha）者，於註釋有 pamukhe sādhūti pāmokkhaṁ, pubbangamaṁ seṭ ṭhaṁ padhānan ti attho 之說明。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0287003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0287003", "type": "orig", "text": "竹施（veludāna）者，依其註釋為：「起於精舍自林持來守護之竹，因我之緣而施，可施予從者而不展轉。如是……為邪命。」而「葉施等亦為同一理趣」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0287004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0287004", "type": "orig", "text": "綠荳汁性（muggasūpatā）者，依其註釋為荳汁之荳，即如半煮，恰似半真之語者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0290005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0290005", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 manāya 讀為 madāya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0292006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0292006", "type": "orig", "text": "原本是 paññāpāsada，應為 Paññāpasāda（慧淨色）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0293007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0293007", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 durānaṁ 讀為 dūranaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0297008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0297008", "type": "orig", "text": "在原本無「心」之語句。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0298009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0298009", "type": "orig", "text": "在原本無「惡作」之語句。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0300010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0300010", "type": "orig", "text": "原文是 chando Kāmo 為（妙欲即為貪欲）之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0336001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0336001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 Siyā uppadiniyo 讀為 isyā uppādino。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0337002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0337002", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 Siyā na na pītisahagatā 讀為 Siyā na pītisahagatā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0351001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0351001", "type": "orig", "text": "原本之 bhāṇena 讀為 ñāṇena。"}
